<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Soon our Lord will come, the Morning Star appear;</l><l>Night is deep, and soon will dawn the day.</l><l>Never with the current of the age we go,</l><l>That from trials we’ll be kept away.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Soon our Lord will come His servants to reward;</l><l>Those who love Him then the crown will share.</l><l>Watchful we must be and treasure not the world,</l><l>Love and serve the Lord, His burden bear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Soon our Lord will come and in His kingdom reign;</l><l>Satan will be bound, the world subdued.</l><l>We must fight the battle, overcome the foe,</l><l>On His throne He then will us include.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
